  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Добавляет новое оружие в стиле <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simpleores\" rel=\"nofollow\">SimpleOres</a> для <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry</a>.</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Частично основано на <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Compatibility</a> от CheezedFish для версии 1.12.2.</strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/KTGh5Ky9WdZTZTBkDWFAiTaq_uUvs3kwxVr6NuL1DPsYirfmyRt5vvT93RIDyNTMfvU=w2400\" width=\"1536\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Поддерживаемые материалы:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Мифрил</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Адамантит</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Оникс</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>Пламя</strong> </span>(дальнего боя) — выпускает горящие снаряды</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Планируемые обновления:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Исправление любых <a href=\"https://github.com/KreloX/SpartanSimpleOres/issues?q=is:open is:issue label:bug\" rel=\"nofollow\">ошибок</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252fkreloxkinetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://1drv.ms/i/c/6bf544900f9867ae/IQR3yxNMtle9S4RxniPeeGgMAVrcnQ4U65DGA1uiSdBUIbE?width=837&height=80&n=-1\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"> </a></p>",
